page: home
title: Home
+++
# Welcome

This whole site is one `.mdy` file — each `---`-separated document is a
page, selected by query and rendered with whatever info the request
passes in. Pages on offer:

{% for (const p of $.find({ page: { $ne: "shell" } })) { %}
- [{{ p.title }}](/{{ p.page }})
{% } %}
---
page: profile
title: Profile
name: stranger
skills: []
+++
{{ $.toc() }}

# Hello, {{ name }}!

Front matter gives this page its defaults (`name: stranger`), the request's
query string overrides them: try [/profile?name=Ada](/profile?name=Ada), or
add skills with repeated params:
[/profile?name=Ada&skills=math&skills=poetry](/profile?name=Ada&skills=math&skills=poetry).

{% const list = [].concat(skills) %}
{% if (list.length > 0) { %}
## Skills

{% for (const s of list) { %}
- {{ s }}
{% } %}
{% } %}

## About this page

The TOC at the top is `{{ "\{\{ $.toc() \}\}" }}` — it resolves against the
final headings, including any this template generates.
---
page: invoice
title: Invoice
number: 0
items: []
+++
# Invoice #{{ number }}

POST JSON to this page to fill it in:

```
curl -s localhost:3000/invoice -H 'content-type: application/json' \
  -d '{ "number": 42, "items": [{ "name": "Tablets", "price": 19.5 }] }'
```

{% if (items.length > 0) { %}
| Item | Price |
| --- | --- |
{% let total = 0 %}
{% for (const it of items) { %}
| {{ it.name }} | ${{ it.price.toFixed(2) }} |
{% total += it.price %}
{% } %}

**Total: ${{ total.toFixed(2) }}**
{% } %}
---
page: shell
title: mdy pages
+++
<!doctype html>
<html lang="en">
<head>
<meta charset="utf-8">
<meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1">
<title>{{ title }}</title>
<style>
  body { font: 16px/1.6 system-ui, sans-serif; max-width: 42rem; margin: 2rem auto; padding: 0 1rem; }
  table { border-collapse: collapse; }
  td, th { border: 1px solid #ccc; padding: .3rem .6rem; }
  code, pre { background: #f4f4f4; }
  pre { padding: .6rem; overflow-x: auto; }
</style>
</head>
<body>
<nav><a href="/">home</a></nav>
<main>
{{ content }}
</main>
</body>
</html>
